### 야간조 기본 스케줄 예시
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/mates/1/schedules
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "dayOfWeek": "MONDAY",
    "scheduleType": "WEEKDAY",
    "shiftType": "CLOSING",
    "startTime": "22:00:00",
    "endTime": "06:00:00"
  }
]

### 야간조 기간 Override 예시
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/mates/1/schedule-overrides
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2026-08-27",
  "endDate": "2026-08-29",
  "startTime": "22:00:00",
  "endTime": "06:00:00"
}

### MATE 현재 근무기준일 / 예정 종료
GET http://localhost:8080/api/mate/shift/today

### shiftDate 근무조 보고서
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/reports/shift/2026-08-27

### 달력일 보고서는 기존 의미 유지
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/reports/daily/2026-08-28
